It seems that the problem of this development should not affect users
as the X11R4 work to support any new graphical hardware would be DEC's
responsibility.  In particular, the use of simple frame buffers on
the low end machines is good (try any intensive 2D line routines on a
mono DECstation 3100), but for good 2D/3D color with lots of planes
